# Stocking the Pantry puts a supply counter for each creature the +1/+1 counters went on (CR 603.2c): Test of Conviction
# (Battle Stations) puts one on each of Bot1's two Ornithopters at once, so two supply counters. A Wildwood Scourge entering
# with two +1/+1 counters is one creature, however many counters, so one more (the Scourge's own trigger is for other creatures).

